WEBVTT

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:01.660
Ce jeu de couple…

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.026
a failli nous séparer.

00:00:03.297 --> 00:00:03.640
Attends,

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:04.125
pourquoi tu me

00:00:04.125 --> 00:00:05.102
montres du doigt ?!

00:00:05.227 --> 00:00:05.507
Parce que

00:00:05.507 --> 00:00:06.634
c'est évident !

00:00:07.292 --> 00:00:08.460
Et le cadeau

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:09.067
« perdu par

00:00:09.067 --> 00:00:09.786
la poste » ?!

00:00:09.856 --> 00:00:10.593
Et toi !

00:00:10.593 --> 00:00:11.033
« J'arrive dans

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:11.714
cinq minutes » ?!

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:15.756
…Ton rire.

00:00:18.023 --> 00:00:18.580
Ok…

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:19.973
Question suivante.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:20.843
Et vous,

00:00:20.843 --> 00:00:21.620
quelle question

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:22.608
a lancé la guerre ?
